==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Dragon Majesty|Wooper|25}} from the {{TCG|Dragon Majesty}} expansion; both cards have the '''Rain Splash''' attack.
*'''Rain Splash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Deoxys|Lotad|63}} from the {{TCG|EX Deoxys}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

